right hand now

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:42.970
you're mostly going to be using this
back top edge here this is a little bit

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:46.299
longer a little bit sharper than the
other edge here so you're going to hold

00:03:46.299 --> 00:03:50.409
it like this move the stick away from
you and towards you back and forth like

00:03:50.409 --> 00:03:54.940
this okay as you do this you'll notice
the wood will shave off as you can see

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.959
here keep doing this until you get close
to the line you aren't trying to chop or

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.680
cut the wood at the intersection of the
blades. Work your way back and forth up

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.280
and down the stick and we're almost done
