00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.790
you can hold the scissors vertically and
that'll smooth things out. As you can see

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:21.280
by that shadow right there we've removed
the excess wood along here at an angle

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.360
all the way up to about right here, okay?
Now, I'm just going to take the nail

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:30.380
filer and I'm just going to go over and
smooth things out and kind of round

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:36.100
okay a little bit.  Take the nail file and
move it up and down along the stick move

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.050
the stick down and then keep on doing
the same thing with the nail file

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.680
relatively at a low angle. Be careful not
